WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.820
There was one café that was on Highway 90 that we would go to every once in a while and buy hamburgers.

2
00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:16.260
It was basically kind of right next to the Mossville community, this place.

3
00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:27.500
It wasn’t in Mossville, but it was right on . . . kind of on the line where it was located at, and buy hamburgers, cheeseburgers.

4
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:33.260
This was basically a white establishment, so we used to go to the back.

5
00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:46.180
We had to go to the back and there was a back room that was . . . The décor was quite different from the front of the place.

6
00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:57.480
I recall that I used to sit in there and they had a swinging door that went from where we were at to the front.

7
00:00:57.480 --> 00:01:10.800
The front was well-lit with red and white checkered tablecloths, and it was windows so it was very, very bright.

8
00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:19.080
The room we were in had no windows and it had a screen door and no air conditioning.

9
00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:22.000
There was air conditioning in the front.

10
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:26.220
It had one ceiling fan and a light hanging by a wire from the ceiling.

11
00:01:26.220 --> 00:01:32.720
And it had one or two tables in there that was just mismatched pieces like they was left over from somewhere.

12
00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:35.060
But the hamburgers were great.

13
00:01:35.060 --> 00:01:37.360
I mean, there was no better.

14
00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:40.520
I think about the hamburgers to this day.

15
00:01:40.520 --> 00:01:54.480
But I recall that when the people would go back and forth between the swinging door that separated the front of the place from the back of . . . the white side from the black side,

16
00:01:54.480 --> 00:02:00.960
that you would feel that rush of cool air conditioned air would roll through the room.

17
00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:09.400
I used to . . . I never did give it much thought then about what it was like to be eating on the other side,

18
00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:14.240
but I was very aware that there was a big difference in the two sides.
